          "summary": "Add the four Harpoon-side indemnity triggers to Section 11.2 and cap the scope of AbbVie's indemnity in Section 11.1.",
          "comment": "[Playbook] We have confirmed in Section 11.2 that Harpoon's indemnity covers third-party IP infringement, Harpoon's breach of Applicable Law, Harpoon-caused unauthorized access to or disclosure of our data, and Harpoon's gross negligence or willful misconduct, and we have limited our own indemnity in Section 11.1 to AbbVie-provided content and AbbVie's breach of Applicable Law. Both edits are additive to the existing lists, so any equivalent trigger already in the redacted text is preserved.",
