            {
              "kind": "insert_after",
              "paragraphId": "p0559",
              "text": "AbbVie's indemnification obligations under this Section 11.1 are limited to Third Party Claims to the extent arising from content or materials provided by AbbVie and AbbVie's breach of Applicable Law."
            },
            {
              "kind": "insert_after",
              "paragraphId": "p0560",
              "text": "Without limiting the foregoing, the matters for which Harpoon shall indemnify and defend the AbbVie Indemnitees under this Section 11.2 include: (a) any Third Party Claim alleging that the Licensed Compounds or Licensed Products, or the intellectual property licensed to AbbVie hereunder, infringe or misappropriate any intellectual property right of a Third Party; (b) Harpoon's breach of Applicable Law; (c) any unauthorized access to or disclosure of AbbVie's Confidential Information or data caused by Harpoon; and (d) Harpoon's gross negligence or willful misconduct."
